      "writtenOn": "2022-02-24T02:13:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Marco,\n\nWe haven\u0027t supported the FF-A (Arm Firmware Framework for Arm A-profile), so the API level would be locked to 4 (TRUSTY_API_VERSION_PHYS_MEM_OBJ) which would not support share physical discontinuous memory.",
      "parentUuid": "1bfb2305_9f8530c9",
      "revId": "684febe23537b8ad6968561f195cc384a6143118",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
